  "Scenes.Katherine.TalkCatGirl.NotLizardMorph": "[say: I'm not saying I'm willing to change into a lizard morph or whatever, but as far as losing my fur? Have to say I liked it. First time in my life I've felt cold standing in the shade. Being a full cat morph means fewer people look at me funny on the street, so there's that, but especially out here in the desert there are advantages to having less fur. The only real downside is how everyone can tell when I'm embarrassed.]"
