  "Scenes.Katherine.TalkCatGirl.RubsHerCheeks": "She rubs her hands against her cheeks and grins at you. [say: It's so different than I expected. I really wasn't sure I wanted this at first, but I'm glad you convinced me. I mean there wasn't anything wrong with being a cat-morph, but I like some of the advantages.][pg]"
